+ * schedule (stages, rotating register names, bundle pairs) is derived.
+ *
+ *   void swgl_yuv42_row_ia64(uint32_t* dst, long n, const IA64YUVRow* p);
+ *   void swgl_yuv42_row_linear_ia64(uint32_t* dst, long n,
+ *                                   const IA64YUVRowLinear* p);
+ *
+ * Each runs n four-pixel steps, bit-exact with the C: the first of
+ * upscaleYUV42R8() (composite.h), whose lane shuffles the gather formulation
+ * in the generator reproduces, the second of linear_row_yuv's generic R8 loop
+ * (textureLinearRowR8 + textureLinearRowPairedR8 + convert, any scale).  The
+ * positions (and fractions) in *p are pre-decremented by one step; *p is not
+ * written.
